WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.450
Good assistance depends on what you are trying to learn.

2
00:00:04.127 --> 00:00:07.177
Try a learning challenge independently first.

3
00:00:07.879 --> 00:00:11.554
Request a hint, or inspect a worked example when needed.

4
00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:16.083
Then try a new question to test your own understanding.
